- Undertaking procurement processes in compliance with MAGENTA’s policies, including conducting negotiations with suppliers;
- Supporting recruitment, onboarding, performance management and offboarding processes, consultant administration and wider HR administration;
- Providing logistics support to project teams, including travel, and maintaining relevant databases and filing systems;
- Supporting audit, compliance, tax, treasury and payroll processes as required;
- Contributing to systems, automation and reporting initiatives across Corporate Services.

